     7	    """Write a function that accepts a list of strings.
     8	    The list contains different words. Return the word with maximum number
     9	    of unique characters. If multiple strings have maximum number of unique
    10	    characters, return the one which comes first in lexicographical order.
    11	
    12	    find_max(["name", "of", "string"]) == "string"
    13	    find_max(["name", "enam", "game"]) == "enam"
