Completed the independent seven-stage audit.

Result: `CONCERNS / LEGIT`. The proof reconstructs successfully, pins the real program, covers the full domain, and is non-vacuous. The concern is the missing complete machine-checked symbolic string-dispatch connection theorem; no false-rule witness was found.

